{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "阿斯特兰 · 掉落池与未鉴定（drop_pools 域）",
  "description": "怪身上的 dp_* 池 + 未鉴定表。权重 w 不必归一。out 以 * 开头 = 动态挑选（按等级/品质）。",
  "type": "object",
  "patternProperties": {
    "^(dp_|unid_)[a-z0-9_]+$": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "name"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "label": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "icon": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "tier": {
          "enum": [
            "普通",
            "精制",
            "稀有",
            "遗物"
          ]
        },
        "kind": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind_key": {
          "enum": [
            "pool",
            "gear",
            "material",
            "tool",
            "junk",
            "keepsake",
            "clue",
            "unidentified"
          ],
          "$comment": "★ B3-6b-2d-keys-2：`kind` 的 **ASCII 机器键**（顶层那个「未鉴定」= unidentified；条目那一层的 kind_key 见 entries/pool 的 items 同名单）。代码只认它（嵌套池 / 未鉴定 / 兜底；K48 / K51 / P-20 甲案第二刀）。条目里那 5 个键（material / tool / junk / keepsake / clue）与 items 的 `kind_key` **同值**（一个词表两处用，probe_drops ⑭ 对账）。映射表唯一来源 = `scripts/rebuild_kind_keys.py`。"
        },
        "rolls": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "level_gated": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "unique": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "from": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "hint": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "seen_after": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "identify_by": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "entries": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "kind_key": {
                "enum": [
                  "pool",
                  "gear",
                  "material",
                  "tool",
                  "junk",
                  "keepsake",
                  "clue",
                  "unidentified"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pool": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "kind_key": {
                "enum": [
                  "pool",
                  "gear",
                  "material",
                  "tool",
                  "junk",
                  "keepsake",
                  "clue",
                  "unidentified"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": true
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
